%% ─── Diagram 1: Primary Admin User Journey (Happy Path) ────────────────────

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant M as Middleware
    participant L as /login
    participant CB as /auth/callback
    participant CC as Command Center (/)
    participant API as API Routes
    participant DB as Supabase

    U->>M: GET /
    M->>DB: getUser() (session check)
    DB-->>M: no session
    M-->>U: 302 → /login?redirect=/

    U->>L: Enter email + password (or magic link)
    L->>DB: signInWithPassword() or signInWithOtp()
    DB-->>L: session token (password) or OTP email

    note over U,DB: Magic link path
    U->>CB: GET /auth/callback?code=...
    CB->>DB: exchangeCodeForSession(code)
    DB-->>CB: session established
    CB-->>U: 302 → / (or ?redirect= target)

    U->>CC: Load Command Center
    CC->>API: GET /api/ai/briefing
    CC->>API: GET /api/revenue (metrics)
    CC->>API: GET /api/classes (schedule)
    API->>DB: queries (studio_id scoped)
    DB-->>API: data
    API-->>CC: JSON responses
    CC-->>U: Render dashboard

    opt Admin creates a class booking
        U->>API: POST /api/bookings (from /schedule)
        API->>DB: atomic insert
        DB-->>API: booking confirmed
        API-->>U: 200 OK
    end

    opt Session expires
        U->>API: Any authenticated request
        API-->>U: 401 Unauthorized
        note over U: No automatic redirect to /login for API calls — user sees 401 JSON
    end


